ional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p003","chapter_id":"c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-nanqi040-zhaozhou-m3-90","person_id":"jle_qnt_6yr","title":"防閤","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanqi040-zhaozhou-m3-90:a","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0092","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003","surface":"防閤","start":90,"end":92}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-040","source_id":"s-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou-ws2272748","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003","quote":"及陳顯達起事，王侯復入宮。昭冑懲往時之懼，與弟永新侯昭穎逃奔江西，變形爲道人。崔慧景舉兵，昭冑兄弟出投之。慧景事敗，昭冑兄弟首出投臺軍主胡松，各以王侯還第。不自安，謀爲身計。子良故防閤桑偃爲梅蟲兒軍副，結前巴西太守蕭寅，謀立昭冑。昭冑許事克用寅爲尚書左僕射、護軍將軍。以寅有部曲，大事皆委之。時胡松領軍在新亭，寅遣人說之，云「須昏人出，寅等便率兵奉昭冑入臺，閉城號令。昏人必還就將軍，將軍但閉壘不應，則三公不足得也。」松又許諾。會東昏新起芳樂苑，月許日不復出遊，偃等議募健兒百餘人從萬春門入突取之，昭冑以爲不可。偃同黨王山沙慮事久無成，以事告御刀徐僧重。寅遣人殺山沙於路，吏於麝中得其事迹，昭冑兄弟與同黨皆伏誅。昭穎官至寧朔將軍、彭城太守。梁王定京邑，追贈昭冑散騎常侍、撫軍將軍，昭穎黃門郎。梁受禪，降封昭冑子周監利侯。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0092"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-nanqi040-zhaozhou-m3-98","person_id":"jle_qnt_6yr","title":"軍副","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanqi040-zhaozhou-m3-98:a","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003:m0092","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p003","surface":"軍副","start":98,"end":100}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-04